    <string name="welcome_title">ka itlhalosetsi go ylih</string>
    <string name="welcome_intro">ylih e bolela mongwe ka ga nako ye earphones e tsadilweng, ka gore go ya leoga o ka araba potso ye o e batlang ka gae: dinako di le kae?</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_auto_title">kopanya gomme go kgone</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_auto_body">bluetooth earphones di bolwe ka tša tsone, go simologa qwa di kopa. ga se na se se seng se lokang gore go nne go itumela.</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_title">pair e le nngwe, lifetime e le nngwe</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_body">fa pair e shwa, e bolwe go bolela gore: total ya yona e ema ka moo gomme pair ya latelago ya earphones e tšwanang e simologa napale go e lela.</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_title">wired le playback</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_body">go bolwa ka mo go naganaditšeng, go go tseno ga bolela earphones tšeo di se di kgoneng gomme di laetša mongwe gore palo ya nako e be e naganana.</string>
    <string name="welcome_privacy">mathata a gone a nna phone ya gago. ga se na account, gomme app ga e na internet permission.</string>
    <string name="welcome_start">simologa</string>
    <string name="welcome_next">latelago</string>
    <string name="welcome_allow">dumela</string>
    <string name="welcome_step">mogalababa %1$d go go %2$d</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_title">bluetooth access</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_why">android e bolela app go fapana ga device ye bluetooth e kopilweng, le gore e bitšwa eng, fa app e bolaela bluetooth access. ke fa ylih e go itsela pair ya earphones go latlha le stereo ya koloi, le gore e itse pair e le nngwe go tšona.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_with">ka yona: pair ka mong e bolewa go simologa gwa e kopilwe, ge go se na go nna go itumela gomme go se na go go gopola gore go kgathale.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_without">nang le yona: bluetooth earphones ga se bolwa ka mong. go kae ga app ga gona le gone, gomme o ka e dumela malatsi a ma go android’s app settings.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_title">notifications</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_why">go bolwa ka mo go naganaditšeng go itumela service ye nkile ya background, gomme android e batla app eng kana kang gona go bolela notification go nna gone le mabu.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_with">ka yona: notification e bonalala se se bolwang ka mo ka gona, gomme ke mo e le go thekeng ge go bolwa ka mo go naganaditšeng go ba morago.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_without">nang le yona: go bolwa ka mo go naganaditšeng ga e na go nna le gone le go bolwa. android ka tsi go sa ke go bonalala notification ya yona.</string>
    <string name="hibernation_title">go nna le count ge o lebala mo go ithuta</string>
    <string name="hibernation_body">android e ema app ye e sa apilweng ka go a lo go mahwi gomme e thola permission ya yona mele, gomme go go bolela ylih recording nothing go e lela. go lebala ka mo go go thwa ke sone sa app, ka gore ke o selo se se se letšeng gore o go thoma gona.</string>
